      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The sources separate two proof roles: self-correspondences provide an algebra on which Frobenius-like operators can be represented, whereas a positive defect inequality or a positive adjoint structure supplies the additional control from which spectral magnitude statements can follow.",
