      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "In both settings a graph–diagonal operation converts fixed-locus geometry into a trace: transverse restriction of a flow kernel produces inverse determinants of return maps, while algebraic intersection of a correspondence graph with the diagonal produces an alternating cohomological trace.",
